OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANo further action against government
OL,4,Aadviser's wife over Palestine Action
OL,5,Apost, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was responding to a discussion
OL,8,Fabout the author Sally Rooney, whose
OL,9,Fnovels will not be supplied to
OL,10,Fbooksellers in the UK following her
OL,11,Fannouncement that she intends to use
OL,12,Fher royalties to support the proscribed
OL,13,Forganisation.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, the Metropolitan Police
OL,16,Fsaid Helm's post was "assessed by
OL,17,Fspecialist officers and it was
OL,18,Fdetermined that it did not meet the
OL,19,Fcriminal threshold".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
