OL,3,AWoman says she was left 'bewildered and
OL,4,Aconfused' by alleged Russell Brand
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FA woman who alleges she was indecently
OL,11,Fassaulted by Russell Brand has told his
OL,12,Ftrial she was left feeling "bewildered
OL,13,Fand confused".
OL,15,FThe woman, who worked at MTV at the
OL,16,Ftime, said the entertainer went from
OL,17,F"jovial" to a "wild-eyed maniac" as he
OL,18,Fattempted, she alleged, to pull her
OL,19,Finto a toilet.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
